      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The 1890 Sanborn map is the earliest available, while the 1911 map is the newest, giving a 21‑year snapshot of Wiconisco’s growth.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        12,
        3
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
